Lead and grow a team of engineers building AI-powered developer tools, owning hiring, ramp-up, and career development

Own the technical direction for the product we’re shipping, partnering closely with staff-level engineers on architecture decisions.&nbsp;

Drive down developer cycle time while raising the bar on correctness - making AI-assisted development both faster and more trustworthy

Partner with Product and Design to shape the roadmap for an early-stage product, translating ambiguous problems into shippable scope

Establish the execution rhythm for your team: planning, delivery, quality, and operational ownership of the services you build

